sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cron as CRE Cron
    participant WF as Finalization Workflow
    participant FIN as UmbrellaEpochFinalizer
    participant Vault as IssuanceVault
    participant Path as CRE Write Path
    participant Tranche

    Cron->>WF: Run every 5 minutes
    loop Vault 1 Senior, Vault 1 Junior, Vault 2 Junior
        WF->>FIN: checkUpkeep(0x)
        FIN->>Vault: currentEpochId()
        alt Completed epoch is waiting
            FIN-->>WF: upkeepNeeded is true
            WF->>Path: Separate report for this ready finalizer
            Path->>FIN: performUpkeep(0x)
            FIN->>FIN: Advance cursor by one epoch
            opt Epoch contains withdrawal shares
                FIN->>Tranche: finalizeEpoch(epochId)
            end
        else Finalizer is caught up
            FIN-->>WF: upkeepNeeded is false
            WF-->>Cron: Finish without transaction
        end
    end
    Note over WF,FIN: At most one epoch per finalizer per run
